<title>USA: FP&amp;L says Turkey Pt 3 restart in 2-3 days.</title>
<headline>FP&amp;L says Turkey Pt 3 restart in 2-3 days.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida Power &amp; Light Co said Tuesday it expects to restart its 666 megawatt (MW) Turkey Point 3 nuclear power plant this week.</p>
<p>&quot;We're looking at a few days, two to three days,&quot; said company spokeswoman Janice Brady.</p>
</text>
